{"key": "c44050169ddb7c9b", "role": "operator", "t": 1790972904.93, "seconds": 5.915, "output": "```python\ndef check_similarity(PURPOSE, Amount):\n    if isinstance(PURPOSE, str) and isinstance(Amount, str):\n        if 'loan' in PURPOSE.lower() and 'loan' in Amount.lower():\n            return 1\n        else:\n            return 0\n    elif isinstance(PURPOSE, dict) and isinstance(Amount, dict):\n        if 'loan' in str(PURPOSE).lower() and 'loan' in str(Amount).lower():\n            return 1\n        else:\n            return 0\n    else:\n        return 0\n\nPURPOSE = \"Car Loan\"\nAmount = \"50000\"\nprint(check_similarity(PURPOSE, Amount))\n```"}
